        "# PlayIQ Module 1: The AI Learning Code",
        "Your brain builds neural pathways only when it encounters productive friction\u2014when you struggle to recall a formula, when you search for the right word, or when you troubleshoot a logic error. If you let the AI do that heavy lifting, your brain atrophies while the AI stays smart."
      ]
    },
    "Module_2_Student_Text.md": {
